<section style="background:#fff; padding:2.5rem 0;">
  <div style="max-width:900px; margin:0 auto;">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:800; color:#b91c1c;">The Contest of Contests: Will You Be the Bride?</h2>
    <p style="font-size:1.1rem; color:#b91c1c;">The Most Holy Place is open. The Bridegroom is calling. The contest is for the 144,000--the Lamb's wife--who keep the commandments of God and the faith of Jesus. Like Queen Esther, the Bride is chosen and unveiled before the world. Will you enter the Ark of the Covenant by faith and claim the promises for victory, miracles, and holiness?</p>
    <blockquote style="background:#fee2e2; border-left:6px solid #b91c1c; margin:1.5em 0; padding:1em 1.5em; font-size:1.1rem; color:#b91c1c;">
      <b>Ellen White:</b> "The 144,000 were all sealed and perfectly united. On their foreheads was written, God, New Jerusalem, and a glorious star containing Jesus' new name." (<b>Early Writings</b>, p. 15)
    </blockquote>
    <p style="font-size:1.1rem; color:#b91c1c;">Compel them to come in! The Ark of the Covenant is open for all who will enter by faith and obedience.</p>
  </div>
</section>

